{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "description": "ScanDebouncer: feed frames in order; each frame lists the payloads visible at time t (milliseconds from an arbitrary start). A payload is a new scan when it was never seen, or when it was last seen rescanGapMs or more before. A sighting always updates the last-seen time. expectScans lists the new scans in the order the debouncer must return them.",
